---
import Site from '../../layouts/Site.astro';
import StoryNarrator from '../../components/StoryNarrator.astro';
import PronunciationAudio from '../../components/PronunciationAudio.astro';
import RegionalParagraph from '../../components/RegionalParagraph.astro';
import {regions,sourcesForRegion,regionalWordCount,type RegionalStoryRecord} from '../../lib/regions';
import {readingMinutes} from '../../lib/stories';
import '../../styles/stories.css';
import '../../styles/regions.css';
export function getStaticPaths(){return regions.map(story=>({params:{id:story.id},props:{story}}));}
interface Props {story:RegionalStoryRecord}
const {story:s}=Astro.props;
---
<Site title={s.title} description={s.deck} active="Stories"><article data-regional-story={s.id}>
<header class="wrap page-head story-header"><a href="/places/">Places &amp; Perspectives</a><p class="kicker">ABẸ́ÒKÚTA · PUBLIC MONEY · REPRESENTATION</p><h1>{s.title}</h1><p class="story-subtitle">{s.subtitle}</p><p class="lead">{s.deck}</p><p class="regional-status">Editorial research draft · private review only · no public release granted</p><p class="fine regional-meta" data-word-count={regionalWordCount(s)}>{regionalWordCount(s)} words · about {readingMinutes(regionalWordCount(s))} min read · Version {s.version}<br/>Independent review pending · No authenticated oral testimony collected</p><p class="fine">{s.scope}</p></header>
<StoryNarrator parts={[{id:s.opening.id,label:'Opening'},...s.sections.map(section=>({id:section.id,label:section.title})),{id:'look-closely',label:s.lookCloser.title},{id:'tradition-evidence',label:'Tradition and evidence'},{id:'unknown',label:'What remains unknown'}]}/>

<div class="wrap story-layout"><div class="story-body"><RegionalParagraph paragraph={s.opening}/>
<details class="story-toc"><summary>In this regional story</summary><nav aria-label="Regional story sections"><ol>{s.sections.map(section=><li><a href={`#${section.id}`}>{section.title}</a></li>)}<li><a href="#read-evidence">Read the inspected evidence</a></li></ol></nav></details>
{s.sections.map(section=><section class="story-section" id={section.id}><h2>{section.title}</h2>{section.paragraphs.map(p=><RegionalParagraph paragraph={p}/>)}</section>)}
<aside class="story-look" id="look-closely"><p class="kicker">LOOK CLOSELY</p><h2>{s.lookCloser.title}</h2><figure class="story-diagram"><img src={`/editorial/${s.illustration}`} width="1200" height="600" loading="lazy" alt="Conceptual questions for reading a water-rate record: proposal, representation, approval. Not a reconstruction of historical government."/><figcaption>Original conceptual illustration · not a historical object, photograph, map or authenticated institutional chart.</figcaption><a class="story-figure-link" href={`/editorial/${s.illustration}`}>Open conceptual illustration at full size</a></figure><p class="story-prose">{s.lookCloser.text}</p>{s.lookCloser.citations.map(c=><a class="fine" href={`#evidence-${c.sourceId}-${c.passageId}`}>Inspected passage for this reading</a>)}</aside>
<section class="story-section" id="tradition-evidence"><h2>Tradition &amp; evidence</h2><p data-narration-text>{s.traditionEvidence}</p></section>
<section class="story-section" id="unknown"><h2>What remains unknown</h2><ul>{s.questions.map(q=><li data-narration-text>{q}</li>)}</ul><p>Further community, linguistic and scholarly review is required. No testimony or contact details are collected here.</p></section>
<section class="story-section"><h2>Words and places in context</h2><dl class="story-glossary">{s.glossary.map(g=><div><dt lang="yo">{g.term}</dt><dd>{g.meaning} <PronunciationAudio text={g.term} compact/> <a href={`#evidence-${g.citation.sourceId}-${g.citation.passageId}`}>Scope source</a></dd></div>)}</dl><p class="fine">Project orthography retained; no new word-origin claim. Independent language review pending.</p></section>
<section class="story-section"><h2>Explore the original archive</h2><ul class="story-related">{s.archiveLinks.map(a=><li><a href={`/articles/${a.id}/#section-${a.section}`}>{a.label}</a></li>)}</ul></section>
<section class="story-section story-evidence" id="read-evidence"><h2>Read the inspected evidence</h2><p>These are separate draft source records, not changes to the original catalogue. A passage was inspected; that does not clear its whole source history, publication rights or every underlying document.</p>{sourcesForRegion(s).map(source=><article class="story-source" id={`evidence-${source.id}-${source.passageId}`}><h3><a href={source.url}>{source.title}</a></h3><p>{source.author} · {source.publisher}</p><p>{source.material} · accessed {source.accessed} · source version {source.version}</p><dl><dt>Exact inspected passage</dt><dd>{source.locator}</dd><dt>Scope and support</dt><dd>{source.scope}. {source.supports}</dd><dt>Evidence limits</dt><dd>{source.limits}</dd><dt>Dependency check</dt><dd>{source.dependency}</dd><dt>Rights and provenance</dt><dd>{source.rights}</dd></dl><p class="fine">Evidence relationship: {source.group}. Shared source groups are not independent corroboration.</p></article>)}</section>
<section class="story-section"><h2>Review &amp; corrections</h2><p>Original paraphrase for private review; public publication is not authorised. No source media, private letter, interview recording or song is reproduced.</p><ol>{s.history.map(h=><li>Version {h.version} · {h.date} · {h.note}</li>)}</ol><p class="fine">Corrections or withdrawal concerns follow the project owner’s existing private editorial process.</p></section>
<nav class="story-next" aria-label="Next regional reading"><p class="kicker">ANOTHER READING, ANOTHER KIND OF EVIDENCE</p><h2><a href={s.next.href}>{s.next.label}</a></h2><a href="/places/">Return to Places &amp; Perspectives</a></nav></div><aside class="story-margin"><p class="kicker">KEEP THE SCOPE VISIBLE</p><p>A proposed charge. A changing council. A question about who is heard.</p><a href="#read-evidence">Read the source passages</a><p class="fine">Private editorial draft. Independent review remains outstanding.</p></aside></div></article></Site>
